    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where old-school cartoon charm meets pure horror. <strong>Horror Camp</strong> is a survival horror puzzle game set in a twisted, ever-changing maze filled with deadly traps, cryptic puzzles, and a relentless monster hunting you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the eerie labyrinth, collect valuable resources, and use strategic thinking to escape before it's too late. Every corner holds a secret, and every decision matters\u2014will you risk searching for upgrades, or will you run for your life?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avoid terrifying creatures lurking around every corner.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Stay on edge as you navigate through a world filled with monstrous beings waiting to strike when you least expect it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/5e2a1fabb324e2c785d992f17835c8c0.poster.avif?t=1751204454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/5e2a1fabb324e2c785d992f17835c8c0.webm?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/5e2a1fabb324e2c785d992f17835c8c0.mp4?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seek out places to regain your lost confidence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Find rare moments of respite to restore your sanity and strength, and keep moving forward in a world designed to break you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/870466fdd9cc303177b7949c164647d9.poster.avif?t=1751204454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/870466fdd9cc303177b7949c164647d9.webm?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/870466fdd9cc303177b7949c164647d9.mp4?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the horror camp\u2019s dark corners to discover ways to enhance your survival skills.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Delve into the hidden areas of the camp, uncovering tools and upgrades that might just give you the edge you need to make it out alive.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/7f2955340f0fd9a4be5e20545ebc7678.poster.avif?t=1751204454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/7f2955340f0fd9a4be5e20545ebc7678.webm?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/7f2955340f0fd9a4be5e20545ebc7678.mp4?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Solve cryptic puzzles hidden within the labyrinths, uncovering clues to escape the horror camp.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Piece together the mysteries buried deep within the camp\u2019s twisted labyrinths, revealing secrets that could be your only hope for survival.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/a6453379e8066d6d169f9320a3817f2d.poster.avif?t=1751204454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/a6453379e8066d6d169f9320a3817f2d.webm?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/a6453379e8066d6d169f9320a3817f2d.mp4?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where old-school cartoon charm meets pure horror. <strong>Horror Camp</strong> is a survival horror puzzle game set in a twisted, ever-changing maze filled with deadly traps, cryptic puzzles, and a relentless monster hunting you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the eerie labyrinth, collect valuable resources, and use strategic thinking to escape before it's too late. Every corner holds a secret, and every decision matters\u2014will you risk searching for upgrades, or will you run for your life?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avoid terrifying creatures lurking around every corner.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Stay on edge as you navigate through a world filled with monstrous beings waiting to strike when you least expect it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/5e2a1fabb324e2c785d992f17835c8c0.poster.avif?t=1751204454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/5e2a1fabb324e2c785d992f17835c8c0.webm?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/5e2a1fabb324e2c785d992f17835c8c0.mp4?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seek out places to regain your lost confidence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Find rare moments of respite to restore your sanity and strength, and keep moving forward in a world designed to break you.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/870466fdd9cc303177b7949c164647d9.poster.avif?t=1751204454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/870466fdd9cc303177b7949c164647d9.webm?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/870466fdd9cc303177b7949c164647d9.mp4?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the horror camp\u2019s dark corners to discover ways to enhance your survival skills.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Delve into the hidden areas of the camp, uncovering tools and upgrades that might just give you the edge you need to make it out alive.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/7f2955340f0fd9a4be5e20545ebc7678.poster.avif?t=1751204454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/7f2955340f0fd9a4be5e20545ebc7678.webm?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/7f2955340f0fd9a4be5e20545ebc7678.mp4?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Solve cryptic puzzles hidden within the labyrinths, uncovering clues to escape the horror camp.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Piece together the mysteries buried deep within the camp\u2019s twisted labyrinths, revealing secrets that could be your only hope for survival.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/a6453379e8066d6d169f9320a3817f2d.poster.avif?t=1751204454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/a6453379e8066d6d169f9320a3817f2d.webm?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607540/extras/a6453379e8066d6d169f9320a3817f2d.mp4?t=1751204454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
